{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>杜如風（Helen）新節目最近在《跟風旅行團》開播，顯著消瘦的身形引發網民熱烈討論，相中的她四肢極為纖細、臉龐線條分明，與昔日較為圓潤的形象大不相同。面對外界對其健康狀況種種揣測與質疑，原來為了新節目，Helen密密發奮！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8-%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98-%e9%a6%96%e7%88%be%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a-3544234/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團｜杜如風帶路首爾掃貨天堂！一文睇清4間熱店資料</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98-%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8-g-dragon-3543139/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團｜杜如風追星追到癲！朝聖GD同款香氛店 突變「G-Helen」跳舞畫面勁爆笑</a></p>\n<h2>杜如風網上大曬遊車河照驚現誇張筷子腿</h2>\n<p>前日杜如風於社交平台發布多張外出用膳及遊車河照片，並配文寫上「遊車河食Fish &amp; Chick! Yummy yummy!!」。相中可見她身穿深色T恤及軍綠色迷你裙靠在名車旁擺姿勢，整個人明顯消瘦一大圈，雙腿纖幼。除了四肢顯得極為纖修外，她在餐廳內拍攝近照亦清楚顯示臉廓線條比以往更加分明，下巴線條變得極度銳利，與過往豐滿形象完全判若兩人。這組充滿震撼視覺效果照片一出，隨即在各大社交平台瘋傳並引發激烈討論。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667987057626124_11859129816a7e923ec731e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 減肥 （圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667987057626124_11859129816a7e923ec731e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>杜如風親自上陣揭顯著消瘦真相</h2>\n<p>面對不少網民好奇詢問其瘦身秘訣，甚至關心是否受藥物影響，杜如風隨即親自於留言區回應外界關注。她公開自己能夠在短時間內成功甩肉終極方法，坦言完全依賴「節食+大量運動」這種極度嚴苛方式達致目前效果。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98-%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8-%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b-3543142/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團｜杜如風買到失心瘋！橫掃3萬款飾品天堂 埋單價錢嚇親網民！</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98-%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8-%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a-3522665/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團｜杜如風闊別9年回歸！轉戰首爾實測網紅店 踢爆旅遊陷阱？</a></p>\n<h2>昔日受嚴重濕疹困擾服類固醇致體重急升</h2>\n<p>回顧杜如風過去幾年身形變化軌跡，她曾經多次因為體重問題成為公眾討論焦點，更一度自嘲身形「肥過部貨車」。事實上她當年發福並非出於無節制飲食，而是因為長期受到嚴重濕疹問題困擾，在醫生建議下需要持續服用類固醇藥物進行治療，最終導致體重出現無法控制急劇上升。這段漫長醫療過程不僅令她承受巨大生理痛楚，更讓她在幕前工作時需要面對無數針對其外貌無情批評。如今她終於擺脫藥物副作用陰霾，透過自身努力重新塑造出全新體態。</p>\n<h2>網民評價兩極</h2>\n<p>這組震撼近照曝光後，網民對杜如風極端瘦身成果展現出截然不同態度。部分支持者對她能夠重返顏值巔峰感到興奮，紛紛留言大讚「靚女番嚟喇」及「發生咩事？瘦咗好多！」，認為她現時狀態充滿少女感。然而另一批網民則對她過度單薄身軀表達強烈擔憂，直指畫面令人心痛並留言勸告「肥番少少會好啲！太瘦了！」。更有不少粉絲也擔心她過度節食會影響健康，溫柔提醒她在保持理想體態的同時，更要注重身體的健康與營養平衡。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667986669446747_2180282186a7e923b171d9.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 減肥 （圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667986669446747_2180282186a7e923b171d9.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667987256295644_1893171986a7e9240c78e1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 減肥 （圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667987256295644_1893171986a7e9240c78e1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667987451180554_11730314466a7e924309e4a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 減肥 （圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178667987451180554_11730314466a7e924309e4a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@Helen To 杜如風）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/175514788534411950_26675105689d6e6daf971.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"杜如風 減肥 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/175514788534411950_26675105689d6e6daf971.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T04:23:55.818345+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1331,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T03:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T05:17:24.304076+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T04:17:21.964648+00:00","content_hash":"8d29089ea0703dd9114cc760132c9aada7695c06dfed360b34d725cc877fd3b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}